01:43:23.856 --> 01:43:27.836 position:63%
They literally crack the doors.
No electric locks. Guard comes

01:43:27.896 --> 01:43:31.576 position:63%
around. Once you hear that guard enter
that thing, you're ready. Because I don't

01:43:31.636 --> 01:43:35.156 position:63%
know. The night before, I could
