01:44:34.996 --> 01:44:38.496 position:63%
Told me and killed him. He said,
man, I'm checking out, brother.

01:44:38.976 --> 01:44:43.056 position:63%
The fuck you going, man? You in here
with me. Boom. My light bulb goes off.

01:44:44.016 --> 01:44:47.816 position:63%
This is right before count, four o'clock
count. In the Bureau of Prisons, or

01:44:47.876 --> 01:44:50.596 position:63%
every prison, 4 p.m. is what
they call a national count.

01:44:51.536 --> 01:44:54.736 position:63%
Every number in the Bureau of Prisons
is called into Washington, D.C.

01:44:55.396 --> 01:45:01.716 position:63%
Right now we have 158,000 last month or so
