what it meant. I still don't know what it

01:47:39.855 --> 01:47:46.096 position:63%
means. I don't try to mean it means.
And it just blew me away that Jack

01:47:47.216 --> 01:47:51.136 position:63%
killed. Because I was there at one point.
You're stuck on crazy. People don't

01:47:51.216 --> 01:47:54.276 position:63%
understand how detrimental the hole and

01:47:54.356 --> 01:47:57.976 position:63%
isolation is to a human being.
We're such a social animal.

01:47:59.056 --> 01:48:00.896 position:63%
I know I am, obviously, you can see. But

01:48:01.736 --> 01:48:05.416 position:63%
