01:48:13.716 --> 01:48:14.376 position:63%
learn.

01:48:14.876 --> 01:48:17.736 position:63%
- Can you just take me through the experience
of what it's like to be in the hole?

01:48:18.256 --> 01:48:21.916 position:63%
- When you go to the hole, and I've been in
the hole for a lot, a long time and a lot of

01:48:21.976 --> 01:48:27.076 position:63%
times, when you get sentenced, first thing,
when you get, let's say you cause an

01:48:27.096 --> 01:48:30.936 position:63%
infraction or you tell a guard to go
fuck himself, you go down and you

01:48:30.996 --> 01:48:33.536 position:63%
go into what they call
administrative segregation.

01:48:34.936 --> 01:48:38.856 position:63%
And in administrative segregation, you're
there until you go what they call a

01:48:38.896 --> 01:48:42.816 position:63%
DHO, which is a disciplinary hearing
officer. That disciplinary hearing officer

01:48:42.856 --> 01:48:49.196 position:63%
then gives you a number of days. Now, he
might give you 28 days, you know, 15, 30,

01:48:49.636 --> 01:48:55.296 position:63%
60 days in the hole. When you had that,
it wasn't as bad because you had a

01:48:55.336 --> 01:48:59.256 position:63%
date. You knew what to look
forward to. You had something to

01:48:59.296 --> 01:49:03.276 position:63%
look forward. When they threw
me in the hole one time after

01:49:03.676 --> 01:49:08.056 position:63%
the prison killed a friend of mine,
he was having pains down his arms and

01:49:08.996 --> 01:49:12.956 position:63%
he goes to medical. Yeah, you're all
right. His own guard he worked for,

01:49:13.016 --> 01:49:16.916 position:63%
he worked what they call CMS, which
is the prison maintenance. So he

01:49:16.976 --> 01:49:20.756 position:63%
works, his own guard he works for said, man,
get to medical. You look terrible. He's been

01:49:20.796 --> 01:49:25.996 position:63%
complaining of stuff. 46 years old and
an Indian guy named, American Indian

01:49:26.456 --> 01:49:32.456 position:63%
named Arch. I used to know him well.
He sold three cells for me. So

01:49:33.616 --> 01:49:37.435 position:63%
He walks back into the unit.
The medical unit's 100

01:49:37.496 --> 01:49:39.796 position:63%
yards away. He walks back in the unit.

01:49:40.636 --> 01:49:44.536 position:63%
Guy named Jimmy Brown and I standing out.
They had four TVs. We're looking at the TVs.

01:49:44.576 --> 01:49:48.456 position:63%
He walks in the door, he goes,
"Man, I'm dying, man." And we

01:49:48.576 --> 01:49:51.256 position:63%
