We put him in a chair.

01:49:52.216 --> 01:49:56.116 position:63%
Boom. Goes over. Dies.
We're trying to help

01:49:56.136 --> 01:49:59.956 position:63%
him. Guards screaming, "Lockdown!
Lockdown!" Well, you go to your cell.

01:50:00.396 --> 01:50:04.276 position:63%
Lockdown. We were trying to help. They
come in. They come down with this

01:50:04.316 --> 01:50:07.636 position:63%
