should be. That's a federal agency.

01:50:57.056 --> 01:50:59.216 position:63%
- By the way, BOP is what?
Bureau of Prisons?

01:50:59.276 --> 01:51:02.336 position:63%
- Bureau of Prisons. Federal, FBOP or BOP,
Bureau of Prisons or Federal Prisons.

01:51:02.356 --> 01:51:05.396 position:63%
- And they're in charge of what? All the
policy for all the federal prisons.

01:51:05.456 --> 01:51:09.296 position:63%
- Right, all federal prisons. That there's
so many prisons around the country and

01:51:09.676 --> 01:51:13.596 position:63%
different levels from the worst prison, one
of them in the world, and you can Google

01:51:13.656 --> 01:51:17.576 position:63%
that. It's called ADX Florence,
Colorado. And then they have what

01:51:17.596 --> 01:51:21.556 position:63%
