01:51:25.616 --> 01:51:29.576 position:63%
or some stupid doctor doesn't do his taxes,
he goes to a camp or some shit. They

01:51:29.616 --> 01:51:33.156 position:63%
couldn't handle a penitentia-
They would be eaten alive. But,

01:51:33.556 --> 01:51:34.876 position:63%
so in the penitentiary,

01:51:35.856 --> 01:51:39.776 position:63%
they said, you know, "Lockdown," and I told
them, "Fuck you," and they put me in the

01:51:39.836 --> 01:51:46.016 position:63%
hole for an investigation. I was in that
