cra- I, you know, I'm, don't,

01:52:30.516 --> 01:52:33.536 position:63%
don't cuff me, you know? I mean,
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

01:52:34.656 --> 01:52:37.716 position:63%
And the hole starts playing
such tricks on your mind

01:52:38.456 --> 01:52:41.816 position:63%
