you're never getting out,

01:52:42.336 --> 01:52:47.816 position:63%
getting out, and now am I gonna live the
rest of my life like this? You start

01:52:48.676 --> 01:52:52.216 position:63%
seeing the same thing, obviously, over
and over, but you, we had things to, to

01:52:52.656 --> 01:52:56.136 position:63%
handle the brain with that, whether it's
exercises, talking to the guy through the

01:52:56.216 --> 01:53:00.156 position:63%
vents. You know, I can make
fire in a hole. I do that on my

01:53:00.236 --> 01:53:04.076 position:63%
channel. People, "How did
you make fire to boil water

01:53:04.136 --> 01:53:08.116 position:63%
