01:54:42.856 --> 01:54:46.816 position:63%
I mean, he's a piece of shit. He's doing
stuff to kids. You gotta remember,

01:54:46.956 --> 01:54:50.836 position:63%
people in prison don't like that either.
We have kids. My biggest fear when I was

01:54:50.876 --> 01:54:54.796 position:63%
in prison was something happening to my young
daughter. I had a 15-month-old daughter when I went

01:54:54.816 --> 01:54:57.276 position:63%
to prison. I got out, she was 13.

01:54:58.156 --> 01:55:01.836 position:63%
I had a seven-year-old son,
I got out, and he was 18. So

01:55:02.556 --> 01:55:06.456 position:63%
my biggest fears in prison were not even
my own life, it was something happening to

01:55:06.496 --> 01:55:10.376 position:63%
my kids, and I could've never ha-
You know, I would've... Forget it. I

01:55:10.436 --> 01:55:14.116 position:63%
mean, it's just something. And so
if you know somebody's a child

01:55:14.176 --> 01:55:18.016 position:63%
molester, and especially, you know,
what he was charged with, and

01:55:18.116 --> 01:55:21.976 position:63%
it's so public. To get a guy, they
could've gave a guy honey buns.

01:55:22.016 --> 01:55:25.976 position:63%
They could've gave a guy anything to kill
that guy. And all he had to- Listen, he

01:55:26.036 --> 01:55:29.476 position:63%
