01:55:39.428 --> 01:55:43.408 position:63%
They didn't check- why do you think
they never came out with this

01:55:43.468 --> 01:55:47.168 position:63%
big autopsy and stuff?
Maybe there was a...

01:55:48.148 --> 01:55:51.408 position:63%
I watched a guy, Lex, they took
down who had a hole in his head.

01:55:52.368 --> 01:55:56.148 position:63%
